  "packageName": "@dsh-external/dsh-client-ui-skin-air",
  "description": "《AIR》夏日青空 — 高定制动漫主题皮肤 for the DeepSeek Harness web GUI. Full-viewport 神尾观铃 (Misuzu) sky backdrop, Q版 mascot sidebar, feather-fall / cloud-drift ambience, magic-circle thinking hook, hot-swappable via dsh-skin-switch. Self-contained: every ornament and photo ships inside this package's own client chunks, so the skin registers no host route, reads no files and makes no network request of its own.",
